        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Stainless Steel Extended Full Lip Strike Plate with Radius Corners</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThese stainless steel door latch strike plates are for use with any manufacturer's tubular entry locks, passage and privacy set. They are especially handy for custom installations and extra thick doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Don-Jo 91xx-630-RC Extended Full Lip Door Strike Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Base Width: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Packaged with Mounting Screws</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 5 Lengths:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n\r\n<b>9115-630-RC</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lip Extension Length: 1-1/2\" Lip</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Width: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<b>9175-630-RC</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lip Extension Length: 1-3/4\" Lip</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Width: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<b>9102-630-RC</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lip Extension Length: 2\" Lip</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Width: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n\r\n<b>9125-630-RC</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lip Extension Length: 2-1/2\" Lip</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Width: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<b>9103-630-RC</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lip Extension Length: 3\" Lip</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Width: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually. </i>\r\n</p>",
